  - Key: poker.ruleset.deal_cards
    Value: At the start of each hand, each player is dealt {0} private cards (Hole
      Cards).
  - Key: poker.ruleset.deal_cards_items
    Value: At the start of each hand, each player is dealt {0} private cards (Hole
      Cards) and {1} items.
  - Key: poker.ruleset.turn_actions
    Value: On their turn, a player can Call, go All In or Fold.
  - Key: poker.ruleset.turn_actions_items
    Value: On their turn, a player can use up to {0} items, then Call or Fold.
  - Key: poker.ruleset.community_cards
    Value: At the end of each round, {0} board cards are revealed in order.
  - Key: poker.ruleset.all_in
    Value: Once someone goes All In, every other player can only Call it or Fold.
      Then every remaining board card is revealed.
  - Key: poker.ruleset.showdown
    Value: Once every board card is revealed, the player with the best poker hand
      wins.
  - Key: poker.ruleset.winner_feeds
    Value: The winner picks one player to eat the Poison Mushroom.
  - Key: poker.ruleset.winner_feeds_item
    Value: The winner picks one player to eat the Poison Mushroom. If that player
      survives, they get one more item.
  - Key: poker.ruleset.losers_eat
    Value: The losers must eat every mushroom they bet.
  - Key: poker.define.title
    Value: Hallucination & Poison Mushroom
  - Key: poker.define.meter_title
    Value: Hallucination Bar
  - Key: poker.define.meter_description
    Value: Each mushroom you eat adds 10% to your hallucination rate. The higher
      it gets, the stronger the effects. At 100% you overdose and are out of the
      match.
  - Key: poker.define.poison_title
    Value: Poison Mushroom
  - Key: poker.define.poison_description
    Value: 'Adds no hallucination. Instead, it triggers a Death Roll: a random chance
      to overdose, based on your current hallucination rate.'
